#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:217
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid "Where does “Export notes” go?"
msgstr "\"エクスポートノート\"はどこに行くのですか？"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:218
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"This guide uses a small Electron app. Clicking {ph0}Export notes{ph1} calls "
"an API in the page, crosses into the main process, and writes a CSV. The "
"behavior is spread across several files."
msgstr ""
"このガイドでは、小さなElectronアプリを使用しています。 クリック {ph0}ノートのエクスポート{ph1} "
"ページ内のAPIを呼び出し、メインプロセスに交差し、CSVを書き込みます。 動作は複数のファイルに分散されます。"

#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:225
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid "The CSV export across Electron processes"
msgstr "CSVは、Electronプロセス間でエクスポートします"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: <code>notes.exportCsv()</code>
#. {ph4}: </span >
#. {ph5}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph6}: <code>renderer.js</code>
#. {ph7}: <code>preload.js</code>
#. {ph8}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:229
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Renderer → preload{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6} calls the API exposed "
"by {ph7}.{ph8}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}レンダラー→プリロード{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6} によって公開されるAPIを呼び出します "
"{ph7}.{ph8}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: <code>notes:export</code>
#. {ph4}: </span >
#. {ph5}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph6}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:237
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Between processes{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}The preload invokes an IPC "
"channel: a named message to the main process.{ph6}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}プロセス間{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}プリロードはIPCチャネルを起動します。これは、メインプロセスへの名前付きメッセージです。{ph6}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph5}: <code>main.js</code>
#. {ph6}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:245
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Main process{ph1}{ph2}An export handler{ph3}{ph4}{ph5} handles that "
"channel and calls the CSV writer.{ph6}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}主なプロセス{ph1}{ph2}エクスポートハンドラー{ph3}{ph4}{ph5} "
"そのチャネルを処理し、CSVライタを呼び出します。{ph6}"

#. {ph0}: <code>csv.js</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>main.js</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>downloads/notes.csv</code>
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:254
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid "{ph0} formats the notes → {ph1} writes {ph2}."
msgstr "{ph0} メモの書式設定→ {ph1} 書き込み {ph2}."

#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:258
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA matches the literal IPC call to its handler and identifies the exposed "
"API. The path is inferred from code; a runtime capture can check what "
"executes."
msgstr ""
"REAは、そのハンドラーへのリテラルIPC呼び出しと一致し、公開されたAPIを識別します。 "
"パスはコードから推測され、ランタイムキャプチャは何が実行されるかを確認できます。"

#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:266
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid "Ask about the CSV export"
msgstr "CSV輸出について尋ねる"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../../get-started/#agent">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:267
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Connect your agent to REA{ph1} and give it the app directory or ASAR "
"file:"
msgstr "{ph0}エージェントをREAに接続します {ph1} そして、それにappディレクトリまたはASARファイルを与えます:"

