#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:216
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Calculate left/right sound panning"
msgstr "左/右のステレオサウンドの位置を計算する"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:217
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"In DX-Ball, a brick hit supplies a horizontal screen position. The sound "
"code turns it into a left/right panning value."
msgstr "DX-Ballでは、レンガのヒットが水平画面の位置を供給します。 サウンドコードは、それを左/右パン値に変換します。"

#. {ph0}: <code>0x00406400</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>__ftol()</code>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:221
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"The starting function, {ph0}, has a short decompiler result: a call to "
"{ph1}. REA also returns its instructions and callers, which give the agent a"
" way to investigate the missing arithmetic."
msgstr ""
"開始機能, {ph0}、短い逆コンパイラの結果を持っています：への呼び出し {ph1}.  "
"REAはまた、エージェントに不足している算術を調査する方法を与えるその命令と呼び出し元を返します。"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:228
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "New to these terms?"
msgstr "これらの条件に新しいですか？"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>MOV</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>ADD</code>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:230
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Instructions:{ph1} the steps the processor runs, shown in readable form"
" such as {ph2} or {ph3}."
msgstr "{ph0}説明書:{ph1} プロセッサが実行する手順は、次のような読み取り可能な形式で示されています {ph2} または {ph3}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:235
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Decompiler result / pseudocode:{ph1} an analysis tool's attempt to turn"
" instructions back into C-like code. It can miss parts, as in this example."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}逆コンパイラの結果/擬似コード:{ph1} 命令をCのようなコードに戻そうとする分析ツールの試み。 "
"この例のように、部品が欠落する可能性があります。"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:240
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Caller:{ph1} a function that calls this one. It shows which values are "
"passed in."
msgstr "{ph0}発信者:{ph1} これを呼び出す関数。 どの値が渡されるかを示します。"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>0x00406400</code>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:244
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Address:{ph1} a location in the program, written in hexadecimal, such "
"as {ph2}."
msgstr "{ph0}住所:{ph1} プログラム内の場所で、次のような16進数で記述されています {ph2}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:248
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Constants:{ph1} fixed numbers stored in the program, read as raw bytes "
"and decoded."
msgstr "{ph0}定数:{ph1} プログラムに格納されている固定番号は、生のバイトとして読み取られ、デコードされます。"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:255
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Three pieces of evidence, one calculation"
msgstr "証拠の三つの部分、一つの計算"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph5}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:259
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}01 · Instructions{ph1}{ph2}An integer input{ph3}{ph4}A stack read "
"supplies the value used by the floating-point instructions.{ph5}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}01*説明書{ph1}{ph2}整数入力{ph3}{ph4}スタック読み取りは、浮動小数点命令で使用される値を提供します。{ph5}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph5}: <code>20 + 30 × tile_x</code>
#. {ph6}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:267
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}02 · Caller{ph1}{ph2}A screen coordinate{ph3}{ph4}The brick-hit caller "
"passes {ph5}.{ph6}"
msgstr "{ph0}02*発信者{ph1}{ph2}画面座標{ph3}{ph4}ブリックヒットの発信者が通過します {ph5}.{ph6}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph5}: <code>1.5625</code>
#. {ph6}: <code>500.0</code>
#. {ph7}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:275
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Data bytes{ph1}{ph2}The numeric constants{ph3}{ph4}Referenced "
"bytes decode to {ph5}, {ph6} and a scale value.{ph7}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}03*データバイト{ph1}{ph2}数値定数{ph3}{ph4}参照されたバイトはに解読します {ph5}, {ph6} "
"とスケール値。{ph7}"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:287
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA supplies the instructions, call relationship and bytes. The agent "
"interprets them together."
msgstr "REAは、命令、関数呼び出しの関係、およびバイトを提供します。 エージェントはそれらを一緒に解釈します。"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:294
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Ask about the behavior"
msgstr "行動について尋ねる"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../../get-started/#agent" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <a href="../../get-started/#native" >
#. {ph3}: </a >
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:295
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"After {ph0}connecting REA to your agent{ph1} and {ph2}setting up a native "
"analysis tool{ph3}, provide the local executable and a question:"
msgstr ""
"後 {ph0}REAをエージェントに接続する{ph1} と "
"{ph2}マシンコードプログラムの解析ツールの設定{ph3}、ローカル実行可能ファイルと質問を提供します:"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:306
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Which analysis tool should I use?"
msgstr "どの分析ツールを使うべきですか？"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:307
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "REA needs one of these to read native programs:"
msgstr "REAは、ネイティブプログラムを読むためにこれらのいずれかが必要です:"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:309
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Hopper{ph1} (macOS or Linux): REA's setup detects it or offers to "
"install it. On macOS, open Hopper once and choose demo mode or activate a "
"license before your first analysis."
msgstr ""
"{ph0} Hopper {ph1} （macOSまたはLinux）：REAのセットアップがそれを検出するか、それをインストールすることを提案します。 "
"macOSでは、Hopperを一度開き、デモモードを選択するか、最初の分析の前にライセンスをアクティブにします。"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:315
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Ghidra{ph1} (macOS or Linux; experimental on Windows): free, but needs "
"an existing Ghidra 12.1.x installation and a 64-bit JDK 21 or newer."
msgstr ""
"{ph0} Ghidra {ph1} "
"（macOSまたはLinux;Windowsで実験）：無料ですが、既存のGhidra12.1が必要です。Xのインストールおよび64ビットJDK21以降。"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:320
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}IDA{ph1} (Windows): for an existing IDA setup with an MCP registration."
msgstr "{ph0} IDA {ph1} (Windows):MCP登録を持つ既存のIDAセットアップの場合。"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../../get-started/#native">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:325
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "See {ph0}Set up native analysis{ph1} for the steps."
msgstr "見る {ph0}マシンコードプログラムの解析の設定{ph1} ステップのために。"

