#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>ECX</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:546
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}01 · Start at zero.{ph1} {ph2} holds the running sum."
msgstr "{ph0}01*ゼロから開始します。{ph1} {ph2} 実行中の合計を保持します。"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:550
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}02 · Check the mask cell.{ph1} A zero value skips the character; a "
"nonzero value includes it."
msgstr "{ph0}02*マスクセルを確認します。{ph1} ゼロ値は文字をスキップし、ゼロ以外の値には文字が含まれます。"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:554
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Add a character code.{ph1} The input's integer at the same offset "
"is added to the sum."
msgstr "{ph0}03*文字コードを追加します。{ph1} 同じオフセットの入力の整数が合計に追加されます。"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:558
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}04 · Move to the next cell.{ph1} The original loop advances four bytes "
"per integer and visits six rows of six cells."
msgstr "{ph0}04*次のセルに移動します。{ph1} 元のループは整数ごとに4バイト進み、6つのセルの6行を訪問します。"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>EAX</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>Incorrect!</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:563
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}05 · Compare with the stored target.{ph1} The caller receives the sum "
"in {ph2}. A mismatch jumps to {ph3}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}05*保存されたターゲットと比較します。{ph1} 呼び出し元は、合計を受信します {ph2}. ミスマッチがジャンプします {ph3}."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:570
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
